{"version":1,"content":"<p>受來自印尼山火引致的霧霾影響，新加坡近日空氣質素持續欠佳。</p><p>當地有跑友上周六（24日）參加了Marina Square商場舉行的活動，讓他們在冷氣商場內跑步，以避開戶外的嚴重霧霾。</p><p>在銀行工作的參加者Angeline Zeng說：「根本沒法在戶外跑步，感覺就像快要窒息一樣。</p><p>」(法新社)</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:22:28.520756+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T09:08:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T18:18:08.853169+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T09:18:47.299737+00:00","content_hash":"a3def6a61f98b268232e5ebe36bd1d4f6c247d5e4b8788ac04529f854eb6516a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}